{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03090",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.7,
      "end_seconds": 2.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.04,
      "end_seconds": 8.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.67,
      "end_seconds": 18.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Um, so... pain in my breastbone wound. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.86,
      "end_seconds": 23.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.79,
      "end_seconds": 27.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I've had it for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.34,
      "end_seconds": 38.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.88,
      "end_seconds": 46.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Coughing definitely sets it off. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.0,
      "end_seconds": 50.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.71,
      "end_seconds": 59.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Okay, so it usually comes with swollen ankles. The swollen ankles? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.51,
      "end_seconds": 63.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.22,
      "end_seconds": 76.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.36,
      "end_seconds": 103.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 86 beats a minute, saturation 97 percent, blood pressure 126 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.81,
      "end_seconds": 108.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.44,
      "end_seconds": 111.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.71,
      "end_seconds": 132.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "The chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.9,
      "end_seconds": 137.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.72,
      "end_seconds": 149.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "And what about breathlessness, chest pain on exertion or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.85,
      "end_seconds": 154.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "No, no breathlessness, chest pain on exertion or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.61,
      "end_seconds": 158.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.88,
      "end_seconds": 161.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.32,
      "end_seconds": 167.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.42,
      "end_seconds": 180.73,
      "duration_seconds": 11.31,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I walk the dog every morning. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.7,
      "end_seconds": 184.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.4,
      "end_seconds": 193.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Clopidogrel. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day. It's simvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.67,
      "end_seconds": 199.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.04,
      "end_seconds": 221.01,
      "duration_seconds": 19.97,
      "text": "I've had heart disease for nearly five years now. I've got high cholesterol. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.56,
      "end_seconds": 233.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Alright, heart disease and high cholesterol, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.26,
      "end_seconds": 248.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Alright, have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.27,
      "end_seconds": 254.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.06,
      "end_seconds": 260.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.12,
      "end_seconds": 265.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Kiwi. I come out in... well, an itchy mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.69,
      "end_seconds": 277.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.41,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with recovering well after bypass surgery. A leg wound infection is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.76,
      "end_seconds": 281.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.42,
      "end_seconds": 314.94,
      "duration_seconds": 32.52,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with recovering well after bypass surgery do well once it's treated properly. I want an ECG done, that's for post-operative review. Walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Let's hold off on blood tests for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.13,
      "end_seconds": 330.25,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Please come and see me in six weeks. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.07,
      "end_seconds": 334.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.99,
      "end_seconds": 337.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}